                  and ʾabuna <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9162TaklaHa">Takla Hāymānot</t:persName> of <t:placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0341DL">Dabra Libānos</t:placeName>.
               </t:floruit>
